          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磁盘空间不足，无法进行此录制：大约需要 %@ 可用空间，当前可用 %@。请释放一些空间后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough free disk space for this recording: it needs about %@ free, and %@ is available. Free up space, or choose Balanced quality or 30 fps." : {
